@page "/pricing"

@layout PublicLayout
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Pricing &amp; Invoicing - Email Money App</PageTitle>

<section class="pricing-invoicing-page">
    <ul class="pricing-key-points">
        <li><strong>Try EMA free for 30 Days</strong></li>
        <li><strong>eTransfers cost $1.00 per transaction - about the same as keying them manually.</strong></li>
        <li>
            <strong>The more etransfers you have, the cheaper the other methods of giving become:</strong>
            <div class="pricing-table-wrap pricing-rate-table-wrap">
                <table class="pricing-table pricing-rate-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Percent Automated eTransfers</th>
                            <th scope="col">Automated eTransfers Fee/Transaction</th>
                            <th scope="col">Other Giving Methods Fee/Transaction</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>25%</td>
                            <td>$1.00</td>
                            <td>$.75</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>75%</td>
                            <td>$1.00</td>
                            <td>$.25</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Invoicing happens at the end of each calendar month, based on the transactions received during the month, and payment is due upon receipt of our invoice.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>We bill based on the transactions we process.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>You can leave anytime, just stop using EMA, and we won’t bill you.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>No contracts. No setup fees. No monthly fees. No surprises.</strong></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="pricing-table-wrap">
        <table class="pricing-table pricing-savings-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Gift Size</th>
                    <th scope="col">$50</th>
                    <th scope="col">$100</th>
                    <th scope="col">$250</th>
                    <th scope="col">$500</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="row">Credit Card (Stripe to CanadaHelps)</th>
                    <td>$1.40 - $2.25</td>
                    <td>$2.50 - $4.50</td>
                    <td>$5.80 - $11.25</td>
                    <td>$11.30 - $22.50</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="row">EMA eTransfer and PAD fee</th>
                    <td>$1.00</td>
                    <td>$1.00</td>
                    <td>$1.00</td>
                    <td>$1.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="row">Savings</th>
                    <td>29% - 56%</td>
                    <td>60% - 78%</td>
                    <td>83% - 91%</td>
                    <td>91% - 96%</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
